        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The foundation of pho is the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "pho-broth"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "pho broth "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Do not skip the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "charring-aromatics"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "charring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " step: it is what separates pho from a plain beef soup. Blacken the onion halves and ginger directly over a gas flame or under the grill until the cut faces are deeply charred, not just browned."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
